{"route":"/tutorials/data-foundations/","title":"Data Foundations Tutorial | Data Learning Hub","description":"A complete beginner-first tutorial on data, structure, measurement, collection, sampling, quality, analytical questions, EDA, reproducibility, and ethics.","canonical":"https://datalearninghub.netlify.app/tutorials/data-foundations/","bodyAttrs":{"data-page":"tutorial-course","data-tutorial":"data-foundations"},"mainHtml":"<main id=\"main-content\" tabindex=\"-1\"><section class=\"tutorial-course-hero\"><div class=\"container\">\n<span class=\"eyebrow\" data-bn=\"Complete tutorial\" data-en=\"Complete tutorial\">Complete tutorial</span><h1 data-bn=\"ডেটা ফাউন্ডেশন টিউটোরিয়াল\" data-en=\"Data Foundations Tutorial\">Data Foundations Tutorial</h1><p class=\"tutorial-lead\" data-bn=\"Data, structure, measurement, collection, sampling, quality, analytical question, EDA, reproducibility ও ethics-এর complete beginner-first tutorial।\" data-en=\"A complete beginner-first tutorial on data, structure, measurement, collection, sampling, quality, analytical questions, EDA, reproducibility, and ethics.\">A complete beginner-first tutorial on data, structure, measurement, collection, sampling, quality, analytical questions, EDA, reproducibility, and ethics.</p>\n<div class=\"hero-actions\"><a class=\"button primary\" href=\"/tutorials/data-foundations/welcome-to-data-analytics/\">Start tutorial →</a><a class=\"button ghost\" href=\"/quiz/data-foundations/\">Take final quiz</a></div>\n<div class=\"tutorial-stat-row\"><span><strong>21</strong> chapters</span><span><strong>16</strong> estimated hours</span><span><strong>EN/BN</strong> bilingual</span><span><strong>100%</strong> static &amp; private</span></div>\n</div></section>\n<section class=\"section\"><div class=\"container tutorial-course-grid\"><div><div class=\"section-heading\"><div><span class=\"eyebrow\" data-bn=\"Course contents\" data-en=\"Course contents\">Course contents</span><h2 data-bn=\"Clear sequence-এ শিখুন\" data-en=\"Learn in a clear sequence\">Learn in a clear sequence</h2></div><div class=\"course-progress-box\"><span>Progress</span><strong id=\"course-landing-progress\">0/21</strong></div></div><section class=\"tutorial-index-module\"><div class=\"tutorial-index-list\"><a class=\"tutorial-index-card\" data-chapter-card=\"welcome-to-data-analytics\" href=\"/tutorials/data-foundations/welcome-to-data-analytics/\"><span>01</span><div><h3 data-bn=\"ডেটা অ্যানালিটিক্সে স্বাগতম\" data-en=\"Welcome to Data Analytics\">Welcome to Data Analytics</h3><p data-bn=\"ডেটা অ্যানালিটিক্স প্রশ্ন ও রেকর্ড করা evidence-কে ব্যাখ্যা, সিদ্ধান্ত ও action-এ রূপ দেয়। এই অধ্যায়ে পুরো learning journey এবং একজন দায়িত্বশীল analyst-এর অভ্যাস দেখানো হয়েছে।\" data-en=\"Data analytics turns questions and recorded evidence into explanations, decisions, and actions. This chapter shows the complete learning journey and the habits of a responsible analyst.\">Data analytics turns questions and recorded evidence into explanations, decisions, and actions. This chapter shows the complete learning journey and the habits of a responsible analyst.</p><small>30 min · Beginner</small></div><b>→</b></a><a class=\"tutorial-index-card\" data-chapter-card=\"data-and-statistics\" href=\"/tutorials/data-foundations/data-and-statistics/\"><span>02</span><div><h3 data-bn=\"ডেটা ও স্ট্যাটিস্টিকস\" data-en=\"Data and Statistics\">Data and Statistics</h3><p data-bn=\"Data হলো recorded observation; statistics data collection design, variation summarize এবং uncertainty-aware conclusion তৈরির method দেয়। এদের পার্থক্য ও সম্পর্ক শিখুন।\" data-en=\"Data are recorded observations; statistics provides methods for designing collection, summarizing variation, and drawing uncertainty-aware conclusions. Learn the difference and how they work together.\">Data are recorded observations; statistics provides methods for designing collection, summarizing variation, and drawing uncertainty-aware conclusions. Learn the difference and how they work together.</p><small>40 min · Beginner</small></div><b>→</b></a><a class=\"tutorial-index-card\" data-chapter-card=\"observations-variables-and-values\" href=\"/tutorials/data-foundations/observations-variables-and-values/\"><span>03</span><div><h3 data-bn=\"Observation, Variable ও Value\" data-en=\"Observations, Variables, and Values\">Observations, Variables, and Values</h3><p data-bn=\"Dataset-এর basic grammar শিখুন: প্রতিটি observation একটি entity বা event, প্রতিটি variable একটি characteristic এবং প্রতিটি cell-এ একটি value থাকে।\" data-en=\"Learn the basic grammar of a dataset: each observation represents an entity or event, each variable records a characteristic, and each cell contains a value.\">Learn the basic grammar of a dataset: each observation represents an entity or event, each variable records a characteristic, and each cell contains a value.</p><small>35 min · Beginner</small></div><b>→</b></a><a class=\"tutorial-index-card\" data-chapter-card=\"rows-columns-tables-and-datasets\" href=\"/tutorials/data-foundations/rows-columns-tables-and-datasets/\"><span>04</span><div><h3 data-bn=\"Row, Column, Table ও Dataset\" data-en=\"Rows, Columns, Tables, and Datasets\">Rows, Columns, Tables, and Datasets</h3><p data-bn=\"Analytical data rectangular table, related table, file ও dataset-এ কীভাবে organize হয় এবং structure কেন answerable question নির্ধারণ করে তা শিখুন।\" data-en=\"Understand how analytical data is organized into rectangular tables, related tables, files, and datasets—and why structure determines what questions can be answered.\">Understand how analytical data is organized into rectangular tables, related tables, files, and datasets—and why structure determines what questions can be answered.</p><small>40 min · Beginner</small></div><b>→</b></a><a class=\"tutorial-index-card\" data-chapter-card=\"categorical-and-numerical-data\" href=\"/tutorials/data-foundations/categorical-and-numerical-data/\"><span>05</span><div><h3 data-bn=\"Categorical ও Numerical Data\" data-en=\"Categorical and Numerical Data\">Categorical and Numerical Data</h3><p data-bn=\"Value-এর meaning অনুযায়ী variable classify করুন। এই choice valid summary, chart, model ও interpretation নিয়ন্ত্রণ করে।\" data-en=\"Classify variables by what their values mean. This choice controls valid summaries, charts, models, and interpretations.\">Classify variables by what their values mean. This choice controls valid summaries, charts, models, and interpretations.</p><small>35 min · Beginner</small></div><b>→</b></a><a class=\"tutorial-index-card\" data-chapter-card=\"discrete-and-continuous-data\" href=\"/tutorials/data-foundations/discrete-and-continuous-data/\"><span>06</span><div><h3 data-bn=\"Discrete ও Continuous Data\" data-en=\"Discrete and Continuous Data\">Discrete and Continuous Data</h3><p data-bn=\"Numerical variable count বা measurement represent করতে পারে। এই distinction possible value, chart, probability model ও data collection-এ কী প্রভাব ফেলে তা শিখুন।\" data-en=\"Numerical variables can represent counts or measurements. Learn why the distinction affects possible values, charts, probability models, and data collection.\">Numerical variables can represent counts or measurements. Learn why the distinction affects possible values, charts, probability models, and data collection.</p><small>35 min · Beginner</small></div><b>→</b></a><a class=\"tutorial-index-card\" data-chapter-card=\"measurement-scales\" href=\"/tutorials/data-foundations/measurement-scales/\"><span>07</span><div><h3 data-bn=\"Measurement Scale\" data-en=\"Measurement Scales\">Measurement Scales</h3><p data-bn=\"Nominal, ordinal, interval ও ratio scale কোন comparison ও arithmetic defensible তা বর্ণনা করে। Practical variable দিয়ে hierarchy শিখুন।\" data-en=\"Nominal, ordinal, interval, and ratio scales describe what comparisons and arithmetic are defensible. Learn the hierarchy through practical variables.\">Nominal, ordinal, interval, and ratio scales describe what comparisons and arithmetic are defensible. Learn the hierarchy through practical variables.</p><small>40 min · Beginner</small></div><b>→</b></a><a class=\"tutorial-index-card\" data-chapter-card=\"data-structures-and-formats\" href=\"/tutorials/data-foundations/data-structures-and-formats/\"><span>08</span><div><h3 data-bn=\"Structured, Semi-structured ও Unstructured Data\" data-en=\"Structured, Semi-structured, and Unstructured Data\">Structured, Semi-structured, and Unstructured Data</h3><p data-bn=\"Data table, tagged record, document, image, audio ও log আকারে আসে। Structure storage, validation ও analytical preparation-এ কী প্রভাব ফেলে তা শিখুন।\" data-en=\"Data comes in tables, tagged records, documents, images, audio, and logs. Learn how structure affects storage, validation, and analytical preparation.\">Data comes in tables, tagged records, documents, images, audio, and logs. Learn how structure affects storage, validation, and analytical preparation.</p><small>40 min · Beginner</small></div><b>→</b></a><a class=\"tutorial-index-card\" data-chapter-card=\"data-sources-and-collection\" href=\"/tutorials/data-foundations/data-sources-and-collection/\"><span>09</span><div><h3 data-bn=\"Data Source ও Collection Method\" data-en=\"Data Sources and Collection Methods\">Data Sources and Collection Methods</h3><p data-bn=\"Analytical data কোথা থেকে আসে, collection choice meaning-কে কীভাবে shape করে এবং analysis-এর আগে provenance কেন document করতে হয় তা শিখুন।\" data-en=\"Learn where analytical data comes from, how collection choices shape meaning, and why provenance must be documented before analysis.\">Learn where analytical data comes from, how collection choices shape meaning, and why provenance must be documented before analysis.</p><small>45 min · Beginner</small></div><b>→</b></a><a class=\"tutorial-index-card\" data-chapter-card=\"population-sample-parameter-and-statistic\" href=\"/tutorials/data-foundations/population-sample-parameter-and-statistic/\"><span>10</span><div><h3 data-bn=\"Population, Sample, Parameter ও Statistic\" data-en=\"Population, Sample, Parameter, and Statistic\">Population, Sample, Parameter, and Statistic</h3><p data-bn=\"Inference-এর language শিখুন: population হলো full group of interest, sample observed হয়, parameter population describe করে এবং statistic sample describe করে।\" data-en=\"Learn the language of inference: the population is the full group of interest, a sample is observed, a parameter describes the population, and a statistic describes the sample.\">Learn the language of inference: the population is the full group of interest, a sample is observed, a parameter describes the population, and a statistic describes the sample.</p><small>45 min · Beginner</small></div><b>→</b></a><a class=\"tutorial-index-card\" data-chapter-card=\"sampling-methods\" href=\"/tutorials/data-foundations/sampling-methods/\"><span>11</span><div><h3 data-bn=\"Sampling Method\" data-en=\"Sampling Methods\">Sampling Methods</h3><p data-bn=\"Sampling design নির্ধারণ করে data-তে কার chance আছে। Probability ও non-probability method compare করুন এবং কখন generalization support করে তা শিখুন।\" data-en=\"Sampling design controls who has a chance to appear in the data. Compare probability and non-probability methods and learn when each can or cannot support generalization.\">Sampling design controls who has a chance to appear in the data. Compare probability and non-probability methods and learn when each can or cannot support generalization.</p><small>50 min · Beginner</small></div><b>→</b></a><a class=\"tutorial-index-card\" data-chapter-card=\"bias-confounding-and-error\" href=\"/tutorials/data-foundations/bias-confounding-and-error/\"><span>12</span><div><h3 data-bn=\"Bias, Confounding ও Error\" data-en=\"Bias, Confounding, and Error\">Bias, Confounding, and Error</h3><p data-bn=\"প্রতিটি difference বা pattern আপনার ধারণার effect নয়। Systematic bias, random error, measurement error ও confounding practical example দিয়ে শিখুন।\" data-en=\"Not every difference or pattern is the effect you think it is. Learn systematic bias, random error, measurement error, and confounding through practical examples.\">Not every difference or pattern is the effect you think it is. Learn systematic bias, random error, measurement error, and confounding through practical examples.</p><small>50 min · Beginner</small></div><b>→</b></a><a class=\"tutorial-index-card\" data-chapter-card=\"data-quality-dimensions\" href=\"/tutorials/data-foundations/data-quality-dimensions/\"><span>13</span><div><h3 data-bn=\"Data Quality Dimension\" data-en=\"Data Quality Dimensions\">Data Quality Dimensions</h3><p data-bn=\"Data quality একটি single score নয়; fitness for use। Context অনুযায়ী completeness, validity, accuracy, consistency, uniqueness, timeliness ও representativeness evaluate করুন।\" data-en=\"Data quality is fitness for use, not a single score. Evaluate completeness, validity, accuracy, consistency, uniqueness, timeliness, and representativeness in context.\">Data quality is fitness for use, not a single score. Evaluate completeness, validity, accuracy, consistency, uniqueness, timeliness, and representativeness in context.</p><small>50 min · Beginner</small></div><b>→</b></a><a class=\"tutorial-index-card\" data-chapter-card=\"missing-duplicate-invalid-and-outlier-values\" href=\"/tutorials/data-foundations/missing-duplicate-invalid-and-outlier-values/\"><span>14</span><div><h3 data-bn=\"Missing, Duplicate, Invalid ও Outlier Value\" data-en=\"Missing, Duplicate, Invalid, and Outlier Values\">Missing, Duplicate, Invalid, and Outlier Values</h3><p data-bn=\"চারটি common data issue, এদের পার্থক্য এবং record delete, replace বা correct করার আগে কীভাবে investigate করতে হয় তা শিখুন।\" data-en=\"Learn four common data issues, why they are not interchangeable, and how to investigate before deleting, replacing, or correcting records.\">Learn four common data issues, why they are not interchangeable, and how to investigate before deleting, replacing, or correcting records.</p><small>50 min · Beginner</small></div><b>→</b></a><a class=\"tutorial-index-card\" data-chapter-card=\"tidy-data-and-organization\" href=\"/tutorials/data-foundations/tidy-data-and-organization/\"><span>15</span><div><h3 data-bn=\"Tidy Data ও Data Organization\" data-en=\"Tidy Data and Data Organization\">Tidy Data and Data Organization</h3><p data-bn=\"Analytical data এমনভাবে organize করুন যাতে প্রতিটি variable একটি column, প্রতিটি observation একটি row এবং প্রতিটি observational unit type একটি table পায়। এতে manual work ও error কেন কমে শিখুন।\" data-en=\"Organize analytical data so each variable has a column, each observation has a row, and each type of observational unit has a table. Learn why this reduces manual work and errors.\">Organize analytical data so each variable has a column, each observation has a row, and each type of observational unit has a table. Learn why this reduces manual work and errors.</p><small>45 min · Beginner</small></div><b>→</b></a><a class=\"tutorial-index-card\" data-chapter-card=\"frequency-tables-and-summary-views\" href=\"/tutorials/data-foundations/frequency-tables-and-summary-views/\"><span>16</span><div><h3 data-bn=\"Frequency Table ও Summary View\" data-en=\"Frequency Tables and Summary Views\">Frequency Tables and Summary Views</h3><p data-bn=\"Frequency table raw value-কে count ও proportion-এ রূপ দেয়। Categorical ও grouped numerical table, cumulative frequency এবং responsible summary শিখুন।\" data-en=\"Frequency tables turn raw values into counts and proportions. Learn categorical and grouped numerical tables, cumulative frequency, and responsible summaries.\">Frequency tables turn raw values into counts and proportions. Learn categorical and grouped numerical tables, cumulative frequency, and responsible summaries.</p><small>45 min · Beginner</small></div><b>→</b></a><a class=\"tutorial-index-card\" data-chapter-card=\"analytical-questions-and-metrics\" href=\"/tutorials/data-foundations/analytical-questions-and-metrics/\"><span>17</span><div><h3 data-bn=\"Analytical Question ও Metric Definition\" data-en=\"Analytical Questions and Defining Metrics\">Analytical Questions and Defining Metrics</h3><p data-bn=\"Decision need-কে answerable question ও precisely defined metric-এ রূপ দিন। Grain, numerator, denominator, time window, filter, comparison ও ownership শিখুন।\" data-en=\"Turn a decision need into answerable questions and precisely defined metrics. Learn grain, numerator, denominator, time window, filters, comparison, and ownership.\">Turn a decision need into answerable questions and precisely defined metrics. Learn grain, numerator, denominator, time window, filters, comparison, and ownership.</p><small>50 min · Beginner</small></div><b>→</b></a><a class=\"tutorial-index-card\" data-chapter-card=\"exploratory-data-analysis-workflow\" href=\"/tutorials/data-foundations/exploratory-data-analysis-workflow/\"><span>18</span><div><h3 data-bn=\"Exploratory Data Analysis Workflow\" data-en=\"Exploratory Data Analysis Workflow\">Exploratory Data Analysis Workflow</h3><p data-bn=\"EDA formal conclusion-এর আগে structure, quality, distribution, relationship ও anomaly-এর disciplined investigation। Reproducible sequence শিখুন।\" data-en=\"EDA is a disciplined investigation of structure, quality, distributions, relationships, and anomalies before formal conclusions. Learn a reproducible sequence.\">EDA is a disciplined investigation of structure, quality, distributions, relationships, and anomalies before formal conclusions. Learn a reproducible sequence.</p><small>55 min · Beginner</small></div><b>→</b></a><a class=\"tutorial-index-card\" data-chapter-card=\"reproducible-analysis-and-documentation\" href=\"/tutorials/data-foundations/reproducible-analysis-and-documentation/\"><span>19</span><div><h3 data-bn=\"Reproducible Analysis ও Documentation\" data-en=\"Reproducible Analysis and Documentation\">Reproducible Analysis and Documentation</h3><p data-bn=\"Reproducible work অন্য person বা future self-কে data বুঝতে, step repeat করতে এবং same result পেতে সাহায্য করে। Practical documentation ও versioning habit শিখুন।\" data-en=\"Reproducible work allows another person—or your future self—to understand the data, repeat the steps, and obtain the same result. Learn practical documentation and versioning habits.\">Reproducible work allows another person—or your future self—to understand the data, repeat the steps, and obtain the same result. Learn practical documentation and versioning habits.</p><small>50 min · Beginner</small></div><b>→</b></a><a class=\"tutorial-index-card\" data-chapter-card=\"data-ethics-privacy-and-responsible-use\" href=\"/tutorials/data-foundations/data-ethics-privacy-and-responsible-use/\"><span>20</span><div><h3 data-bn=\"Data Ethics, Privacy ও Responsible Use\" data-en=\"Data Ethics, Privacy, and Responsible Use\">Data Ethics, Privacy, and Responsible Use</h3><p data-bn=\"Legal permission একমাত্র test নয়। Purpose limitation, data minimization, privacy, security, fairness, transparency ও responsible communication শিখুন।\" data-en=\"Legal permission is not the only test. Learn purpose limitation, data minimization, privacy, security, fairness, transparency, and responsible communication.\">Legal permission is not the only test. Learn purpose limitation, data minimization, privacy, security, fairness, transparency, and responsible communication.</p><small>55 min · Beginner</small></div><b>→</b></a><a class=\"tutorial-index-card\" data-chapter-card=\"mini-project-retail-data-audit\" href=\"/tutorials/data-foundations/mini-project-retail-data-audit/\"><span>21</span><div><h3 data-bn=\"Mini Project: Retail Dataset Audit\" data-en=\"Mini Project: Audit a Retail Dataset\">Mini Project: Audit a Retail Dataset</h3><p data-bn=\"Documented retail-sales CSV-তে পুরো Data Foundations tutorial apply করুন। Question define, structure inspect, quality profile, finding organize ও responsible analytical brief লিখুন।\" data-en=\"Apply the entire Data Foundations tutorial to a documented retail-sales CSV. Define questions, inspect structure, profile quality, organize findings, and write a responsible analytical brief.\">Apply the entire Data Foundations tutorial to a documented retail-sales CSV. Define questions, inspect structure, profile quality, organize findings, and write a responsible analytical brief.</p><small>90 min · Beginner</small></div><b>→</b></a></div></section></div><aside class=\"course-side-card\"><h2>Course tools</h2><a href=\"/exercises/data-foundations/\">Chapter exercises <span>→</span></a><a href=\"/examples/data-foundations/\">Worked examples <span>→</span></a><a href=\"/references/data-foundations/\">Reference library <span>→</span></a><a href=\"/quiz/data-foundations/\">Final quiz <span>→</span></a><hr/><p>This tutorial contains complete learning content, practice, assessment, and project work.</p></aside></div></section></main>","scripts":["/assets/js/tutorial-core.js","/assets/js/tutorial-index.js"],"inlineScripts":[]}